Cure Poison is a clerical prayer that purges toxins from the target's body.
Through divine intervention, the poison is neutralized and expelled, ending
its harmful effects.

Usage: cast 'cure poison' <target>

This prayer removes poison afflictions including magical poisons and food
poisoning. However, it only addresses the poison itself - any damage already
suffered, unconsciousness, or other secondary effects must be healed through
other means.

The prayer is most effective when cast quickly after poisoning, before the
toxin has time to cause extensive damage. Clerics often keep this prayer
ready when exploring areas known to harbor venomous creatures.

Class: Cleric
Discipline: Aegis

